{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious galaxies one after another in a high-dimensional universe known as <strong>String Realm</strong>. Each galaxy harbors unique civilizations and abundant resources. Discover and strive to survive within perilous sectors to establish your strongholds. Mine, transport, manufacture, and advance your talents and technology. Battle hostile factions and alien creatures to secure their data for research and cultivation. Evolve your <strong>Flux-Core Vessel</strong> into a higher-tier craft, enabling your journey into even more dangerous reaches of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/extras/bc99df65046ca7b9475d8a9ee55fe503.avif?t=1770723976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/extras_big/bc99df65046ca7b9475d8a9ee55fe503.webp?t=1770723976 width=1560 height=929 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a multitude of mysterious star systems, each teeming with unique resources, the skeletal remains of <strong>derelict megastructures</strong>, and <strong>hidden outposts</strong> tucked away within planetary rings. A vast array of breathtaking vistas and deep-space secrets awaits your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/extras/879b2f5228926a402ded31d00fb15a2b.avif?t=1770723976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/extras_big/879b2f5228926a402ded31d00fb15a2b.webp?t=1770723976 width=1560 height=929 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, gather, and bring resources back to the <strong>Ark\u2019s Bio-Chamber</strong> for processing. Craft and manufacture to unlock talents for various <strong>sub-classes</strong>, gaining access to advanced technological blueprints and high-tier materials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/extras/6eea3367606f359dac807303da0a1847.avif?t=1770723976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/extras_big/6eea3367606f359dac807303da0a1847.webp?t=1770723976 width=1560 height=929 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every galaxy boasts its own unique cosmic environment. Encounter the starships of diverse factions or come face-to-face with eerie, otherworldly organisms. You can <strong>establish a stronghold</strong> anywhere that piques your interest\u2014defend your territory against all odds, or utilize it as a <strong>navigation beacon</strong> for your next warp jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/extras/70cfdc6a5c552b2d22c7096ea7d5545b.avif?t=1770723976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/extras_big/70cfdc6a5c552b2d22c7096ea7d5545b.webp?t=1770723976 width=1560 height=929 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you encounter in these unknown sectors will offer richer experiences and deeper choices. Forge your path as a <strong>lone wolf</strong> of the stars, or <strong>team up</strong> with others to explore, discover, and conquer the ultimate challenges.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3070430?t=1770723976","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/929048fc17f0b553928a92b113e938e744c165c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770723976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/e7d7b5f8f00045584e22c169e8c208f2261e482f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770723976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/e7d7b5f8f00045584e22c169e8c208f2261e482f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770723976","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious galaxies one after another in a high-dimensional universe known as <strong>String Realm</strong>. Each galaxy harbors unique civilizations and abundant resources. Discover and strive to survive within perilous sectors to establish your strongholds. Mine, transport, manufacture, and advance your talents and technology. Battle hostile factions and alien creatures to secure their data for research and cultivation. Evolve your <strong>Flux-Core Vessel</strong> into a higher-tier craft, enabling your journey into even more dangerous reaches of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/extras/bc99df65046ca7b9475d8a9ee55fe503.avif?t=1770723976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/extras_big/bc99df65046ca7b9475d8a9ee55fe503.webp?t=1770723976 width=1560 height=929 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a multitude of mysterious star systems, each teeming with unique resources, the skeletal remains of <strong>derelict megastructures</strong>, and <strong>hidden outposts</strong> tucked away within planetary rings. A vast array of breathtaking vistas and deep-space secrets awaits your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></