ncounter in these unknown sectors will offer richer experiences and deeper choices. Forge your path as a <strong>lone wolf</strong> of the stars, or <strong>team up</strong> with others to explore, discover, and conquer the ultimate challenges.</p>","developers":["\u5e7f\u5dde\u5e02\u661f\u6770\u7f51\u7edc\u79d1\u6280\u6709\u9650\u516c\u53f8"],"genres":[{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070430/bcf65d652b3b25bf3fe845dbdf65f7c4365aa3fd/header.jpg?t=1770723976","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"> Diagnostic Data and Log Uploads<br />\r\n><br />\r\n> 1 Consent to Diagnostic Tools: User acknowledges and agrees that the Software integrates third-party diagnostic tools (specifically, CrashSight) to maintain software stability and security.<br />\r\n><br />\r\n> 2 Data Collection: In the event of a software crash, unresponsiveness, or runtime error, the Software may automatically collect and upload system environment data (e.g., hardware config, OS version), exception stack data, and local application log files to the server.<br />\r\n><br />\r\n> 3 Usage Limitation: The Developer warrants that the sole purpose of collecting such information is to analyze error causes, fix software defects, and optimize product performance. The Developer will not use this feature to scan files or data on the User's device that are unrelated to the Software.<br />\r\n><br />\r\n> 4 Data Anonymization: While the Developer makes reasonable efforts to anonymize uploaded logs, the User understands that log files may inadvertently contain internal identifiers (such as Steam ID) or records of in-game actions. The User consents to the upload of such data as a necessary part of the technical support services provided by the Software.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</s